WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:08.087
The most recent data for 2024 records 16,265 MAID deaths in that calendar year alone.

00:00:08.037 --> 00:00:13.162
This represents 5.05 percent of all national mortality.

00:00:13.162 --> 00:00:23.925
Since legalization in 2016, the cumulative total of individuals whose deaths were administered by the state has reached 76,475.
